  "scope": "Actual pipe poll readiness, timed waits and external startup observation; no game or complete Frida acceptance",
  "root_cause": "poll reported empty anonymous pipe read ends as readable. GLib/Frida repeatedly polled, read EAGAIN and retried.",
  "changes": [
    "Query anonymous pipe data, write quota and closing state with system NtQueryInformationFile.",
    "Report Linux POLLIN/POLLOUT only when requested and ready; retain HUP/ERR without a matching requested bit.",
    "Bound mixed pipe/socket wait slices to 10 milliseconds and keep the original poll deadline.",
    "Return EOF from a nonblocking pipe read after its writer closes and buffered bytes drain.",
    "Apply nonblocking PeekNamedPipe only to real pipe handles; no new dependency or general event framework."
  ],
